    "description": "Coyote outdoor gas grill repair across all seven Southern California counties. C-Series built-in grills (C3C30, C3C34, C3CH36, C3CL36, C3CL42, C3CO50) and S-Series grills (C3SL30, C3SL36, C3SL42) with the RapidSear infrared burner, illuminated control knobs, and interior grill lights. Ignition electrode, RapidSear infrared burner, standard burner replacement, LED knob and interior-light circuit, regulator, and grate service. Natural gas and liquid propane. BHGS #A49573.",
    "provider": { "@id": canonical + "#business" },
    "areaServed": [
      { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Los Angeles County" },
      { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Orange County" },
      { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Ventura County" },
      { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Santa Barbara County" }, { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "San Bernardino County" },
      { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Riverside County" }, { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "San Diego County" }
    ],
