    <h2>What we do for Coyote, and what we don't.</h2>

    <p><strong>We service:</strong></p>
    <ul class="bullet-list">
      <li>C-Series built-in grills (C3C, C3CH, C3CL, C3CO model codes)</li>
      <li>S-Series grills (C3SL30, C3SL36, C3SL42)</li>
      <li>RapidSear infrared burners</li>
      <li>Illuminated control knobs and interior grill lights (LED circuit)</li>
      <li>Ignition electrodes, standard burners, cooking grates, regulators</li>
      <li>Natural gas and liquid propane configurations</li>
    </ul>

    <p><strong>We don't do:</strong> new grill installation (a gas-line trade); custom island or cabinetry modification (a fabrication trade); Coyote charcoal, pellet, or flat-top units are handled case by case, so call and we will tell you if it is in scope before dispatch.</p>

    <p>If your Coyote is under manufacturer warranty, we can assess the failure and tell you whether it is warranty-eligible before any out-of-pocket work.</p>
