    <h2>What separates our Coyote service from general grill repair.</h2>

    <ul class="reasons-list">
      <li><strong>RapidSear infrared fluency.</strong> The S-Series infrared burner fails differently than the tube burners. We diagnose the element, orifice, and ignition separately rather than swapping a whole burner on a guess.</li>
